WEBVTT

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.060
Nobody's gonna come by in this rain.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.030
Guess I'll close up shop.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:42.290
Excuse me, can I apply for a job here?

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.810
We're not actually taking applications at the moment.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:49.540
I don't care how low the pay is. I want to work here.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.020
Come in.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:02.550
What's your name?

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.860
Arashiyama Sayako.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.340
Arashiyama?

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.140
Yes.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.160
Please call me Arashi.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:03:00.180
No matter how much time passes, the
warmth of summer never changes.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:04.260
So, every time summer comes around,

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:10.230
I remember my days as a young boy of thirteen, when I knew nothing at all...

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:15.240
Even now, it remains unchanged within me.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.360
July 21st

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.280
Summer

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:28.730
I'm lost.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.580
The Ark Café?

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:44.060
Girl A

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:44.060
Arashiyama Sayoko

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.880
This isn't good - this place looks pricey...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.410
Sorry, I've got the wrong address!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.940
Welcome!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.050
A table for one?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.630
Yes.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.950
Is a seat at the counter all right for you?

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.130
Yes.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:22.190
Please call me over when you've decided on your order.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.640
I'll have an iced coffee.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.390
Of course. One I.C, coming up!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.640
Yo.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:37.500
Are you in middle school?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.040
Yeah, I'm in seventh grade.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.230
Really?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.510
Thank god...

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.010
So am I!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:47.840
I came to stay with my grandpa in the countryside, but I got lost...

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.390
I was starting to feel all alone.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.550
Are you from the city?

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:56.260
No, I'm from a place even more out in the sticks than this.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.830
I'm Yasaka Hajime.{name} Nice to meet you.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:03.780
Kamigamo Jun. Hi.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.660
Here you are, sir.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.460
Please enjoy.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.300
So, what's your grandpa's address?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.530
If you want, I can take you there late-

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.880
Hey, Kamigamo.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:27.210
The first time I laid eyes on that waitress,
a strange feeling ran right up my butt!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.140
Do you think this is a premonition of love?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.760
Master, some salt, please.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.710
Man, women older than me are so great...

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:49.370
Their adult ways and words stimulate our imaginations
and reveal an almost indescribable divinity...

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.240
You're just looking at her tits.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.400
How could you tell?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.800
What do you mean by women older than you? Pervert.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.620
It's natural for guys to look at those things!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.310
Besides, it's no fun looking at girls our age.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:07.580
Man, you're such a loser. I bet all the girls hate you.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.150
What the hell?! What did I ever do to you?

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.660
Hey, kid.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.510
Shut up.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.170
S-Sorry.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.540
Arashi, we're out of beans.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.350
Fetch me some more, will ya?

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.270
Right!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.990
Her name's Arashi?

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.200
Excuse me. About that salt...

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.440
Here's my card.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.620
A private detective?

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.320
I'm looking for someone.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.500
Her name is Arashiyama Sayoko.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.900
Sixteen years old.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.810
Female.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.140
Long, straight black hair.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.350
Can't help you there. Never seen any girl like that.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.800
That so?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.020
You sure?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.210
Whaddya mean by that?

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.780
I've done some background research on you.

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:06.900
I know all about your real job.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:10.870
I can take that info to the cops, if you like.
You sure you've never seen her?

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:15.940
I've finished grinding the beans, Master.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:16.970
Arashi!

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.360
Arashiyama-san, is it?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.840
I've come to pick you up.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.530
Your family is looking for you.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.280
You're coming with me.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.200
No, I'm not.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:33.210
I understand your feelings, but I've been ordered
to drag you back by your hair if I have to.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.220
Though, I'd rather it doesn't come to that.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.550
Just come along quietly and nobody gets...

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.470
JUMP KICK!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.660
Hey...

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:55.360
Are you all right, miss?

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.440
Idiot, you...

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:04.860
Hey,

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:09.220
you know what happens now, right?

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.420
Wait a second!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.340
Yasaka!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.490
Wh-What?

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.570
What just happened?

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.440
I see.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.500
That'll be all for today.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.980
I'll be back later.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.920
Thank you for saving me.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:50.130
Huh? Oh, no, I did it without thinking...

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.140
I wasn't really any help at all.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:53.650
No, you were awesome.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.170
Wh-What the heck...

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.980
We connected?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.640
Come with me!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.640
Quickly!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.360
Wait a second!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.410
Arashi-san...

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.550
What was that?

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:24.000
Static electricity?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.420
Excuse me... the salt, please?

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.630
This is Sogoru.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.220
Put me through to Yoshiyama.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.290
Yeah, we've got a new job.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.350
Where are we going?

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.310
Just come with me!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:42.800
Her hand is so cold... and she's not sweating at all.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.100
We're jumping straight through!

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.110
Wh-What?!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.840
Where are we?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.850
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.490
We did it!

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.530
You connected with me!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.590
Wh-What are you on about?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.280
Where are we?

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.350
What the heck is going on?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.890
This is how the city looked when I was alive.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.960
"Was"? Then, that means you're a...

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.180
Yes.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.840
I am a gho-

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.810
A dream?

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.200
Are you awake yet?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.130
Arashi-san?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.190
I'll take you to your grandpa's house.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.910
Yeah, it must have been a dream,
 or an illusion, or heatstroke!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:56.750
Scientific speaking, that's impossible.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.400
By the way, Arashi-san?

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.520
What's with your huge bag?

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.740
Don't climb up so high that you can't get down again!

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:23.410
This is my luggage.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.980
I'll be living with you from now on.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.520
Because...

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:32.010
I'm a ghost and I'm possessing you.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:35.380
Ghost? Possessing?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.080
I'll be living with you from now on, OK?

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.860
I wonder if it's going to end...

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:56.360
No, it won't.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.090
We've found hope.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.140
We've found our future.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.620
Anyway, I'm amazed your grandfather was fine with it.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.430
He's got a soft spot for pretty girls...

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:16.330
"Oh, you can stay as long as ya like, little missy!"

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.420
Am I heavy?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.910
Not at all...

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.360
It's weird, isn't it? Even though
I'm a ghost, I'm still heavy.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.150
You still don't believe me.

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:28.320
Well, whatever.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:29.340
I'll help you!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:30.790
Let me steer.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:33.280
We'll crash! We'll crash!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.440
I'm fired?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.250
I'd seriously love to hire you, but...

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:41.860
Don't blame me.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:45.280
Wait! She hasn't done anything wrong!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.430
That dude with the shades was
sniffing around here again.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.030
I don't want any trouble.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.800
Shouldn't you just call the police?

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.290
If only it were that easy...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.310
Why can't you?!

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:00.980
Geez, be quiet.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.120
Stay out of this.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.190
You have no idea what's going on!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.900
That's not true!

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:07.850
Arashi-san is...

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:18.400
Anyway, I don't care about the past
of the girl I'm in love with!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.090
Fine, fine.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:22.620
Then, you want to settle this fairly?

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.440
Odd numbers are "han".

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:27.290
Even numbers are "cho".

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.930
If you win, I'll do anything you say.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.160
OK, I accept!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.840
All set?

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.190
All set.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.820
Cho or Han?

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.320
OK...

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.100
They fell out!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.010
She didn't notice?

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.600
OK, the dice are down!

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:50.340
This is what you get. Idiot.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.060
Cho!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.320
Too bad.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.490
It's han.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:04.720
No way!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.010
What the hell was that about?!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.050
You thought you'd win?

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:09.010
You're such a kid.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.280
You're the one who tricked me!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.130
A loss is a loss.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.330
Now pay me.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:17.150
Let's go again!

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.340
One more time, fair and square this time!

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:21.200
All right.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.620
Cho or Han?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.290
Han!

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:25.930
Cho with a two.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:29.170
You've got no clothes left to take off.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:30.010
All done?

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:30.920
No, I'm not!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.280
He'll strip!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.360
No, I won't!

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.920
Enough.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.790
You can't beat me.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.190
And this is better for Arashi, isn't it?

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:48.200
I don't know if you ran away or whatever,
but if you don't want to be dragged back,

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.520
now's the time for you to disappear.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.790
I'm sorry I couldn't help you.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.290
It's fine, don't worry.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.200
It's not your fault.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.830
You'll have to find a new job.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.590
No, I'm not gonna bother.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.530
I only know this area of town.

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:15.210
And I like that café.

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.720
Arashi-san...

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.710
OK, I'm going shopping.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:21.900
Hold down the fort for me.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:27.860
Are you insane? Asking a middle schooler you
don't even know to stand in for you...

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.440
Don't complain. I beat you fair and square.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:33.080
Just be glad you got to keep your clothes on.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.760
Why has this happened to me?

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:40.250
What am I doing?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.900
Excuse me, pass the salt...

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.460
Oh Master, did you forget something?

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.480
You know what I'm here for.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.770
I'm the only one here right now.

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:54.940
Liar.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:58.620
What kind of nutjob would let a middle schooler
she doesn't even know tend shop for her?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.990
He's pretty annoying too...

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.310
You say something?

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.780
The master is out shopping at the moment.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.090
She'll be back soon.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:08.960
Like I care.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:12.220
She's not even the real master of this store.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.510
She's a con artist.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:17.190
A pretty famous one.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:25.700
Sham marriages, fake businesses, stocks, gambling,
insurance scams... tons of stuff.

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:28.010
And she's never been caught for any of them.

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:29.640
She's a crazy old fox.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.830
This coffee shop's a place she rolled into a while ago.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.950
Once she finds something to sell,
she'll be gone in an instant.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:37.960
Something to sell?

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:40.240
Like the deed to this place or something.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:43.820
The place is falling apart, but if you wanted
to sell it, it'd be worth a pretty penny.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.860
But Arashi-san, what's so special about that café?

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:02.460
I guess because it hasn't changed
at all since I was alive.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:08.710
And they say there's something
important hidden in there.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.260
Something important?

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:12.920
A secret treasure no one knows about.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:18.350
Oh, there you two are.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.320
I've been looking everywhere for you.

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.560
I was so worried!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.670
What the hell...

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:25.190
That's creepy as hell.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.660
So, Arashi...

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:31.520
You're related to that coffee shop?

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:33.180
I...

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:35.530
Don't say another word.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:39.450
Was that lunkhead trying to take you back to your mansion or something?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:43.590
Come to think of it, I can picture you as a rich girl...

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.580
I think I can see what you're after too...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.290
There you are.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:54.140
This time, miss, you're coming with me.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:56.130
Oh no you don't, Shades!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:03.400
Kid, I let you win yesterday, but you know what's
going to happen if you fight me, right?

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.700
Shut up!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.570
There are times in a man's life when he can't
step aside, even if it costs him his life!

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.420
Oh, I'm aware.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.580
In that case, die.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.690
Wait, wait!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.060
Hold up a second, mister.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:18.300
How about the two mature adults work this one out between them?

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.460
Who asked you to help us?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.240
Who said I was helping you for free?

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:29.540
Hey, Arashi, that treasure you were talking about - could you tell me where it is?

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.460
What?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.290
If I don't help you, he's going to take you away, you know.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.810
Are you a demon?

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:38.550
All right.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.470
Are you sure, Arashi-san?

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:43.380
You're going to hand over something that important to someone like her?

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:45.600
Yeah, we've got no choice.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.720
OK, then it's decided.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.390
Make sure you keep your end of the bargain.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.650
What?

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.980
You're going to challenge me to a game?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.740
Let's play and whoever loses just walks away.

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.750
No way. Who'd be dumb enough to play games with a con artist?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.710
Neither of us want to cause a scene, do we?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.900
I don't really care.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:05.020
That so?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:09.030
These "relatives" that want you to take her back to... You checked up on them?

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:14.280
You might end up being charged with kidnapping.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.490
So don't you think we oughta avoid violence here?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:20.440
OK, I'll decide the rules.

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.260
Then, it's decided.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.840
First one to the café wins.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.070
OK.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.810
Is this really OK?

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.310
I won't lose to a bonehead like this.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.530
What tricks are you going to use to win?

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.330
You underestimate me.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:43.990
I always win when it counts.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.970
Listen to her babble.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:48.720
She's just waiting for her chance to pull one over on me.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.930
I bet she'll pull ahead and toss coffee beans on the road behind her.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.860
But that plan won't work.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.360
Ready?

00:19:57.360 --> 00:20:01.170
You'll never get in front of me.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.140
Because...

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:02.880
Go!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.870
My machine's got an extra-large cab, headers,

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.390
a bored-out engine with iridium spark plugs,

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:15.000
a lightweight chassis, a reinforced clutch,
a high-efficiency exhaust manifold,

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:20.450
and to top it off, a nitrous kit powered
by a dentist's anesthetic!

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.980
I'm not gonna lose to an old jalopy!

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.990
Come on! Just you try and keep up!

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.790
Just you try!

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:36.940
You're in quite a hurry.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:38.820
Would you mind pulling over?

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.810
I'm actually in the middle of a race here...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.870
You've got some guts, buddy.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:46.250
OK, your license please.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:49.880
You shouldn't break the speed limit, mister.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.330
You reported me, didn't you?!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.370
Good work, officer!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.150
Good work!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.290
Good!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.690
That's cheating!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.240
Please sign here, sir.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.050
This is how I pay my bills.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:12.920
But are you sure it's OK to tell her where the treasure is, Arashi-san?

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.750
Yeah.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.580
I was told not to tell anybody, but it's OK.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.550
The person who hid it there is long gone now anyway.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.630
No, it's nothing.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.170
How is this treasure?

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.260
What the hell am I supposed to do with this?

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:36.130
You're pretty good, Master.

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.140
This is...

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:40.280
Tops?

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.250
You're burying it again?

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.800
Yeah, it's for the best.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.760
Whose treasure was it?

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:50.180
My neighbor's, Kan-chan.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.040
They told me to keep it a secret.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.000
Kan-chan?

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:57.810
Jinjou Elementary

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:57.810
Kan

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.820
Jinjou Elementary...

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:01.340
Yeah, an acquaintance from when I was still alive.

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:07.750
The summer I'll never forget, when I was thirteen.

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:13.120
This is how my stormy summer began.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:18.240
How are you feeling, Yayoi?

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:20.940
I'm feeling good, Kanako.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:27.460
The book that detective gave me was so enjoyable, I lost track of time and kept reading late into the night.

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:31.680
Perhaps that's why I feel so good today.

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:32.680
I see.

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:34.280
I'm glad to hear that.

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:36.830
What's the name of this book you like so much?

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.100
Well...

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:41.050
I forgot the title.

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.720
Then, can you remember what happens in it?

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:45.910
Yes. I'd be happy to.

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:50.750
It's a story about a journey through time,

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:55.400
where a visitor appears before a young boy from beyond the distant horizon of time.

00:22:55.400 --> 00:23:00.160
This visitor is a messenger of good fortune, weaving the future in a dream seen by a distant relative.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:03.860
To cut the chains of destiny binding his descendants to an unhappy fate,

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:06.790
the visitor travels with the young boy through all eternity.

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:08.930
Holding in his breast a rift between time and space,

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:12.220
within which lie contrivances formed from hope and dreams,

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:15.480
he invites the young boy on a journey to the other side of time!

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:18.790
My, what a wonderful story!

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:23.460
This azure feline automaton has a catchphrase he always says.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:25.960
And what would that be, pray tell?

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.830
Dokodemo Do-

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:33.020
When you think of summer...

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:34.180
...you think of fireworks!

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:35.380
Aren't snake fireworks great?

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:36.240
Yeah, pretty standard!

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:36.910
Smoke bombs and stuff.

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:37.860
Those too!

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:39.000
Clacker balls!

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:40.370
All of those are fireworks for the daytime...

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:41.960
The night is for getting drunk and sleeping.

00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:44.050
Get up bright and early again tomorrow!

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:50.560
<i>Get up bright and early next time!</i>

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:50.560
Drawing by Houjyou Yutori
